e and after World War II. Discusses core theoretical concepts guiding the comparative analysis of political systems. The main part of the course consists of a discussion of the political cultures, parties, electoral systems, and current problems confronting the political systems of various countries focusing on Italy which is treated in depth. The course concludes with an analysis of the European Union (EU) as political system.", "catalogBreadth": "", "catalogDistr": "(SBA-AS)", "catalogEnrollmentPriority": null, "catalogLang": "", "catalogForbiddenOverlaps": "", "catalogAttribute": "(CU-ITL)", "catalogWhenOffered": "Summer.", "catalogComments": "", "catalogPrereqCoreq": "", "catalogPrereq": null, "catalogCoreq": null, "catalogFee": "", "catalogSatisfiesReq": "", "catalogPermission": "", "catalogCourseSubfield": "", "catalogOutcomes": null, "acadCareer": "UG", "acadGroup": "AS", "lastTermsOffered": null, "exploreCriteriaIds": null}, {"strm": 2734, "crseId": 368788, "crseOfferNbr": 2, "subject": "GOVT", "catalogNbr": "3887", "titleShort": "Int'l Human Rights Theo & Prac", "titleLong": "Int'l Human Rights in Theory & Practice", "crseAttrs": [], "crseAttrValueGroups": [], "enrollGroups": [{"classSections": [{"ssrComponent": "LEC", "ssrComponentLong": "Lecture", "section": "001", "classNbr": 1147, "meetings": [{"classMtgNbr": 1, "timeStart": "09:30AM", "timeEnd": "12:00PM", "startDt": "06/24/2019", "endDt": "07/12/2019", "instructors": [{"instrAssignSeq": 2, "netid": "eb456", "firstName": "Elizabeth", "middleName": "", "lastName": "Brundige"}], "pattern": "MTWRF", "facilityDescr": "Myron Taylor Hall 277", "bldgDescr": "Myron Taylor Hall", "facilityDescrshort": "MTH277", "meetingTopicDescription": ""}, {"classMtgNbr": 2, "timeStart": "02:00PM", "timeEnd": "03:30PM", "startDt": "06/24/2019", "endDt": "07/12/2019", "instructors": [{"instrAssignSeq": 2, "netid": "eb456", "firstName": "Elizabeth", "middleName": "", "lastName": "Brundige"}], "pattern": "R", "facilityDescr": "